{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-03",
  "title": "傭兵一日",
  "storyCode": "13-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "322cd03f41ce5bf78ae593bbebd0fc3e1807bea6eb4d560b31e2ad86d53502e1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，到底怎麼了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事，放血療法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伊內絲，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一點事都沒有。你們該給我解釋一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我懂了，這些石頭對冷酷的老女人無效。凱爾希絕對能在這裡跳舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信她可以，我建議你先把傷口包紮好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刺得很準，避過了動脈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，這是針對薩卡茲的裝置？與血液有關？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲，血，呵，還真是難猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些巫術裝置……還沒有真正啟動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……因為有一些不安的感覺而靠近這裡，原來這就是元兇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也難怪老師們對待倫蒂尼姆的事情總是謹慎過頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那真正啟動起來會怎麼樣？所有薩卡茲爆體而亡？然後血魔大君就會用我們的血潑那些維多利亞人一身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "附近……沒有車轍，沒有運輸痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們就把這些巨大的結晶，跨過遙遠的距離，直接投放到了這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我好像不是第一次聽說這種手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "埃芒加德女士……這似乎也與您無關吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。巫妖沒辦法做到這樣的事，我們研究的，不是此處的“空間”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以及，您剛才似乎，認出我來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫德雷嘛……我注意到過你的書，有些手抄本甚至流傳到了萊塔尼亞的薩卡茲之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您有什麼線索嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我為什麼要幫你們？你剛炸掉了我的小方塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我至少沒往你胸口的那個洞裡塞炸彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯哼。現在的薩卡茲雇傭兵都這麼急於求死嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "談到剛才的幻境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是些殘跡……空間的，時間的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們剛才在找轍痕？幻境就是轍痕。某種特殊的法術影響了這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但那不是源石技藝，不是薩卡茲巫術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些法陣確實與血魔有關，而幻境也確實和法陣有關，但又沒有直接聯繫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說不定……你會用到這些線索呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……巫妖們的態度是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和往常一樣，沒有任何允諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可有線人告訴我，卡茲戴爾最近……也出現了一些巫妖，你們平時可不怎麼在卡茲戴爾亮相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你離開巴別塔，然後加入感染者組織，最後來到倫蒂尼姆，卻還能在卡茲戴爾留下情報網路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的只是個僱傭兵？我覺得你的才幹，至少能在萊塔尼亞撈個金律法衛當當。哦，就是你的法術不太厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "個人習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯哼。“個人習慣”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這片戰場如此寬廣，如果我真有意悄無聲息地離開，你覺得憑你們能攔得住我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您……也在找我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算是吧。我對你有點興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們薩卡茲聊天一定要繞圈子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你都能收到卡茲戴爾的消息，那對兄妹自然只是視而不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們需要，嗯，為特雷西斯準備一些，後手。我們正在接管卡茲戴爾。大家都來維多利亞了，總得有人照看著點老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼後手，慶功宴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，這是計劃的第一部分。再立個建國日之類的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，不開玩笑了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——這確實就是計劃的第一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯和特蕾西婭絲毫沒有撤退的打算，他們似乎真的想要把倫蒂尼姆變成和整片大地決戰的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們也不知道他們究竟哪來的自信，但既然是他們兩兄妹的計劃，就一定有早就準備好的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，如果他們真的成功了——我們將確實地重建卡茲戴爾，重建薩卡茲的樂土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……如果失敗了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果薩卡茲在這裡遭遇了失敗，那我們損失的，將是一整代年輕人，也許還有未來所有的年輕人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在兩百年前的那場遠征之後，大部分國家對卡茲戴爾的現狀並不了解，也不感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到現在，維多利亞的許多上位者還以為卡茲戴爾不過是一片廢墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但內戰前，在特蕾西婭殿下的建設之下，卡茲戴爾已經有了移動城市的雛形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但特雷西斯攪亂了一切。卡茲戴爾現在不過是個超級巨大的巫術機器罷了，一邊走還一邊往下掉零件的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾根本扛不住所謂的戰爭，而攝政王恰恰還掀起了一場戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在開戰以後，各方的探子一定已經開始接觸卡茲戴爾。那些作壁上觀的國家，又會怎麼看待領土內的……薩卡茲們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，你是個悲觀的人。挺好的，我也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，計劃的第二部分——現在留在卡茲戴爾的巫妖已經做好了拆分卡茲戴爾的計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果特雷西斯失敗，卡茲戴爾將會立刻被分割為幾塊，甚至十幾塊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帶著附屬的居民區，按照劃分好的，呃，“氏族”單位，藏進荒野的深處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "規劃路線，平衡生產，確保卡茲戴爾變成移動城市這件事不是毫無意義。對薩卡茲而言，其他人類的敵意就是天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾將會迎來又一個流亡時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲已經緊緊團結在了一起，雖然並非以我期望的方式……但就結果而言，特雷西斯做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但團結的意義，可以不僅僅是又一次復仇和殺戮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕這種團結是建立在仇恨和戰爭上？這可不容易啊，赫德雷大哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾不僅是一座城市，還是每一個把那裡視為家的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在原本的計劃裡，卡茲戴爾不需要很多居民……他們也不可能允許我們帶走很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們需要結束這場在維多利亞的戰爭，越早越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果仇恨無法挽回，我們最起碼可以利用它的熱量，澆築在卡茲戴爾的支架上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而每一條生命，對於未來的卡茲戴爾，也許都很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說得倒簡單——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們剛剛提到的，可以遠距離運送物資和人員的手段。這恐怕就是我們一直在調查的，軍事委員會在倫蒂尼姆的“生命線”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會找到它，控制它。它既然能讓我們來到倫蒂尼姆，那麼……也能帶我們回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在所有人都被埋葬以前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我……\n你未必會成功，你只是個僱傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“讓所有人都有家可回。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……和你接觸確實是正確的。我會把你的打算，以……巴別塔殘部的態度，告知巫妖們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你們把我的小方塊炸了！你們讓我怎麼回去，靠走的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "西北八公里的位置，有一個薩卡茲運輸營地，搶他們的車去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "需要幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可不想再被她逮到一次，讓她發現我在和你們偷偷做什麼交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，祝你們好運，祝你們在見過她之後……還能活下來，達成你們的諾言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們有沒有……一種熟悉的感覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
